%% Figure 5.4 - Level-1 DFD of the analysis
flowchart LR
  I[Investor] -->|request| P1((1.0 Capture context))
  P1 -->|snapshot| P2((2.0 Read comment and detect bias))
  P2 -->|bias, confidence| P3((3.0 Simulate hold vs sell))
  P3 -->|curves, p| P4((4.0 Explain EN/HI))
  P4 -->|narrative| P5((5.0 Recommend + both sides))
  P5 -->|verdict| P6((6.0 Seal audit record))
  D1[(D1 users / financial_profiles)] -->|read profile| P3
  P1 & P2 & P3 & P4 & P5 -->|write step outputs| D2[(D2 decisions)]
  P6 -->|append entry| D3[(D3 audit_logs)]
